OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'horrified' over granddad's
OL,4,Afour-day hospital bed wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 72-year-old man who
OL,7,Fspent several days sitting in a chair
OL,8,Fin Altnagelvin Hospital's Emergency
OL,9,FDepartment while waiting for a bed said
OL,10,Fthey had been left feeling "helpless
OL,11,Fand horrified."
OL,13,FMike Kelly was taken by ambulance to
OL,14,Fthe Londonderry hospital on 6 September
OL,15,Fwith an infection in his foot and after
OL,16,Fhaving an angina attack at home.
OL,18,FHis granddaughter Enya Kelly said he
OL,19,Fsat in a chair in an emergency
OL,20,Fdepartment hallway for four days, was
OL,21,Fin "excruciating pain" and was unable
OL,22,Fto get any sleep.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
